<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37051" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ-έδρα</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hall</i> or <i>arcade furnished
				with recesses and seats,</i> in the gymnasia, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1449
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Kon.</u>
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				12.182
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Olbia</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(3).1091
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Melos</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				931.26
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, etc.; in the schools of Philosophers, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Acad.Ind.</u>
				p.100M.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				17.1.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Fin.</u>
				5.2.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				5.11.2
			</span></i>; in a private house, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bench, seat,</i> in front of a house, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				4.19
			</span></i>; any <i>public bench,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				13.4.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				28.2
			</span></i>; <i>belvedere,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.Dam.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>parlour</i> or <i>saloon,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ez.</u>
				40.44
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Orat.</u>
				3.5.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>ND</u>
				1.6.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				6.7.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.3.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				912.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; <i>the hall in Pompey's theatre at
			Rome,</i> where the Senate met, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Brut.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>.</div>
